# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Approved stage S13 routes.
#
# Every one of them takes the ACCOUNT from `_require_portal_user`, i.e. from the
# signed session cookie, and re-resolves the dataset through
# `_get_portal_database_dataset_for_user` before it touches a stored object. No
# route here accepts an owner identifier, and every object lookup carries the
# owner in its `WHERE`, so a guessed or stolen object id is indistinguishable
# from one that does not exist.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


