# --------- Canonical platform login/logout aliases (Phase 1) ---------
# `/login` and `/logout` are the canonical platform routes. They delegate to the
# existing Artifact Explorer login/logout helpers so there is exactly one
# identity model, one session cookie, and one set of behaviors. The original
# `/artifact-explorer/login` and `/artifact-explorer/logout` routes remain fully
# compatible.
